'''Boulder''' (大岩, ''Ōiwa'', '''Boulder''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy. It was added in [[Version 13.6 Update|Version 13.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Boulder
|image = E 696.png
|appearance = [[Summer Break Cats Castaway#Jungle Survival|Jungle Survival]]
|money drop = 250¢ - 987¢
}}

==Enemy==
Boulder is pretty unassuming at first, with low health and even lower damage, however at the 1000% magnification in [[Typhoon Warning]], it can deal 20,000 damage with 100,000 health.

==Strategy==
Boulders are a pretty standard peon that appear throughout the Jungle Survival stages and can be easily taken out with any unit that inflicts solid enough damage. Outside of the last level, they aren't necessarily a threat and can be swiftly taken down.

In Resist the Raging Current, the best strategy is to spam powerful Cats without using any meatshields at all. Since Boulder and [[Log]] have Omni Strike, using meatshields will just let them hit your attackers easier.

